4839502},{"w":0.62349370320638031,"t":"... of solid wood are glued together to create building blocks. These","x":0.26009328653807329,"y":0.77259459115869022,"h":0.020238492496288507,"c":1},{"h":0.019921212478590244,"t":"blocks are lighter than concrete and steel but equal them in strength. Experts say","c":1,"y":0.79730397703563527,"w":0.76324900309244792,"x":0.087310590423400447},{"x":0.085251653744024145,"y":0.81766180084208417,"w":0.77706710815429691,"h":0.025877064262223803,"c":1,"t":"that wooden buildings are an improvement on those made of concrete and steel in"},{"t":"terms of the 8 ..","x":0.085239666624787658,"h":0.016998364695136048,"w":0.14806636810302734,"y":0.84795358018859734,"c":1},{"y":0.84614776001355407,"w":0.48963506062825518,"t":"... with which they can be constructed and how much","x":0.37848952567593436,"h":0.019616146028227477,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.32815533955891929,"t":"noise is generated by the process.","y":0.87352024951680229,"x":0.087378640764789808,"h":0.017468122678382381},{"w":0.025242718060811353,"x":0.87961165075114767,"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1,"y":0.94912790709906214,"t":"63"}],"h":3209}